◆ /pipeline  native pipelines, one agent turn per stage
  list                  installed pipelines and recent runs here
  run <name> [inputs]   start a run (free text fills the main input; key=value sets others)
  run                   resume the current or latest unfinished run
  approve               approve the stage the run is waiting on, then continue
  status [run]          stage track of a run
  inspect <name|run>    a pipeline's inputs and stages, or a run's evidence
  rerun [stage|run]     reset a stage and its dependents, or repeat a run
  stop                  pause after the current stage
